# Circle
> Circle is a global financial technology firm and the full-stack platform for the internet financial system, providing the tech stack for the agentic economy — including USDC, EURC, Arc, and a full suite of APIs, wallets, and developer tools for moving money, building onchain applications, and powering AI-native finance.

Use this file as a curated "start here" map for Circle's most authoritative pages. For technical integration questions, prefer Circle Developer Docs (developers.circle.com). For legal, risk, and terms, prefer circle.com/legal and circle.com/transparency.

## Core Products (overview pages)

### Stablecoins & Digital Assets
- [USDC](https://www.circle.com/usdc): US Dollar Coin (USDC), a fully-reserved, dollar-backed stablecoin. The world's largest regulated digital dollar.
- [EURC](https://www.circle.com/eurc): Euro-backed stablecoin. The world's largest regulated digital euro.
- [USYC](https://www.circle.com/usyc): Tokenized money market fund providing institutional-grade, yield-bearing collateral with near-instant onchain liquidity.
- [cirBTC](https://www.circle.com/cirbtc): Institutional-grade wrapped Bitcoin token backed 1:1 by BTC with onchain verifiability.
- [USDC on Multiple Chains](https://www.circle.com/multi-chain-usdc): Supported blockchains and contract addresses for USDC.
- [Bridged USDC Standard](https://www.circle.com/bridged-usdc): Circle's standard for bridged USDC deployments.
- [USDC.com](https://www.usdc.com/): Official USDC resource hub.

### Liquidity & FX
- [Circle Mint](https://www.circle.com/circle-mint): Mint, redeem, reserve, and manage USDC, EURC, and cirBTC at global scale.
- [StableFX](https://www.circle.com/stablefx): Institutional-grade onchain foreign exchange engine for 24/7 stablecoin currency conversion.

### Payments
- [Circle Payments Network (CPN)](https://www.circle.com/cpn): Global, real-time settlement network connecting financial institutions worldwide.
- [CPN Fiat Payments](https://www.circle.com/cpn/fiat-payments): Send fiat globally at stablecoin speed.
- [CPN Stablecoin Payments](https://www.circle.com/cpn/stablecoin-payments): Build on full-stack stablecoin payments infrastructure.
- [CPN Managed Payments](https://www.circle.com/cpn/managed-payments): Launch-ready stablecoin payment solution.
- [Digital Asset Accounts](https://www.circle.com/digital-asset-accounts): Branded digital asset account infrastructure — Circle handles custody, fiat-to-stablecoin conversion, onboarding, and compliance.

### Blockchain Infrastructure
- [Arc](https://www.arc.io): An open Layer-1 blockchain built to meet the demands of the global internet economy. Arc Mainnet launches September 16, 2026.

### Developer Infrastructure
- [Developer Platform](https://www.circle.com/developer): Circle's full developer platform: wallets, contracts, CCTP, paymaster, and more across 40+ supported blockchains.
- [Circle Agent Stack](https://www.circle.com/agent-stack): Full-stack platform for the agentic economy — enables AI agents to hold USDC, discover services, and execute transactions programmatically.
- [Wallets](https://www.circle.com/wallets): Embeddable wallet infrastructure for building commerce at enterprise scale.
- [Contracts](https://www.circle.com/contracts): Smart contract tooling and curated template library.
- [Cross-Chain Transfer Protocol (CCTP)](https://www.circle.com/cross-chain-transfer-protocol): Native crosschain USDC transfer protocol.
- [xReserve](https://www.circle.com/xreserve): Infrastructure for blockchain teams to launch their own USDC-backed, interoperable stablecoins with onchain reserves.
- [Gateway](https://www.circle.com/gateway): Unified USDC balance across multiple blockchains with on-demand liquidity in under 500ms.
- [Paymaster](https://www.circle.com/paymaster): Pay gas fees with USDC.
- [Alliance Program](https://www.circle.com/alliance-program): Partner ecosystem program.
- [Circle Partner Stablecoins](https://www.circle.com/partner-stablecoins): Grow your stablecoin with Circle's infrastructure.

